OL,5,G2300 Frozen Planet
OL,6,     FWinter: During winter most animals
OL,7,     Fabandon the polar regions, but a
OL,8,     Ffew extreme survivors remain. This
OL,9,     Fis the story of their battles to
OL,10,     Fendure the planet's harshest
OL,11,     Fwinters.
OL,12,G0000 Frozen Planet
OL,13,     FThe Last Frontier: The penultimate
OL,14,     Fpart of David Attenborough's
OL,15,     Facclaimed nature series. This
OL,16,     Fepisode looks at us humans, one of
OL,17,     Fthe polar regions' most ingenious
OL,18,     Finhabitants.
